On **Thursday 22 October 2026**, **Malaga Event Gear (MEG)** supplied the **sound and a technician** for an event in the centre of Malaga, Spain. The event was held for **[Tinkle](https://www.tinkle.es/)**, a communications agency with offices in Madrid, Barcelona and Lisbon, which was working for **[easyJet](https://www.easyjet.com/en/)**, the low cost airline.

It was a compact job in a setting that is attractive and not easy to work in. We are reporting it because it shows what a sound only job for an agency looks like.

![A talk in progress on a low stage at the Tinkle event for easyJet in the centre of Malaga, with a screen showing slides behind three seated speakers and a PA speaker on a stand in the foreground.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/3113/2026.10.22-tinkle-easyjet-malaga-spain-sound-and-technician-3-1536x864.webp "A talk in progress at the Tinkle event for easyJet in the centre of Malaga on 22 October 2026, with our sound system in the foreground.")

## What We Supplied

Sound and a technician, and nothing else. The stage, the screen, the seating, the plants and the decoration that you can see in the photographs are not Malaga Event Gear equipment.

On our side there was the sound system: a mixing console, handheld microphones and PA speakers on stands. The photographs show the sound desk with a clear view of the stage.

![A mixing console with two handheld microphones in the foreground and a PA speaker on a stand, facing a low stage with a screen and seats, at an event for Tinkle and easyJet in the centre of Malaga.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/3114/2026.10.22-tinkle-easyjet-malaga-spain-sound-and-technician-1-1536x1152.webp "Malaga Event Gear supplied the sound system and a technician for this Tinkle event for easyJet in the centre of Malaga on 22 October 2026.")

## A Talk in the Centre of Malaga

The photographs show a talk with three speakers seated on a low stage, with a screen beside them for the slides. The hall has arched galleries and colourful banners, and the job took place in the centre of Malaga, an attractive place to hold an event and a demanding one to work in.

The venue is not named here.

![The sound desk with a mixing console, two handheld microphones and a laptop in the foreground, and a PA speaker on a stand and a low stage with a slide screen in the distance, at the Tinkle event for easyJet in Malaga.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/3110/2026.10.22-tinkle-easyjet-malaga-spain-sound-and-technician-4-1536x1152.webp "The sound position at the Tinkle event for easyJet, with a view of the stage.")

## A Request That Came in by Phone

The request reached us by phone the week before the event. The brief was sound and a technician, in the centre of Malaga.

## What a Talk Like This Needs From the Sound

For a talk with a few seated speakers, the sound has three jobs:

-   **A microphone for each person who speaks.** A handheld microphone is the simplest choice for a talk, because each speaker can pick it up when it is their turn. Our guide to [wireless handheld microphone rental](/blog/wireless-handheld-microphone-rental/) explains the handheld microphones we own and which packages include one.
-   **A speaker that covers the audience.** The PA speaker goes on a stand, at a height where the room hears the speakers clearly. Our [sound system rental](/blog/sound-system-rental/) guide explains the sound systems in each of our packages.
-   **A technician at the desk.** Someone sets the levels before the talk, watches them while it runs and solves any problem with the sound. At our events the technician operates the sound and the microphones, and the speakers run their own slides.

![A close view of a mixing console with cables plugged in and a handheld microphone beside it, with a PA speaker on a stand and a slide screen out of focus behind, at the Tinkle event for easyJet in Malaga.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/3111/2026.10.22-tinkle-easyjet-malaga-spain-sound-and-technician-5-1536x1152.webp "A handheld microphone ready beside the mixing console at the Tinkle event for easyJet in Malaga.")

![A mixing console and two handheld microphones next to a laptop, with a PA speaker on a stand and a low stage with a slide screen behind, at the Tinkle event for easyJet in Malaga.](https://cdn.malagaeventgear.com/blog/3112/2026.10.22-tinkle-easyjet-malaga-spain-sound-and-technician-2-1536x1152.webp "The sound desk and the sound system we supplied for the Tinkle event for easyJet, with the stage and the screen behind, which are not ours.")

